### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = test-deletion@example.com
@username = testuser
@password = Test1234!

### 1. Inscription (créer un user de test)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Connexion (récupérer le token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Extraire le token de la réponse précédente
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Vérifier le profil AVANT suppression (optionnel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Supprimer le profil (anonymisation)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Essayer de se reconnecter (doit échouer car anonymisé)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}